{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27919","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 九 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹迳通邻圃，清深称独游。\n虫丝交影细，藤子坠声幽。\n积润苔纹厚，迎寒荠叶稠。\n闲来寻古画，未废执茶瓯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}